          "id": "c1",
          "value": {
            "language": "en",
            "text": "Sardar Raja College of Engineering (SRCE) is an engineering college in Tamil Nadu, India. Its website describes it as a private institution established in 2000 and based in Tirunelveli. The college says its undergraduate and postgraduate courses are affiliated with Anna University and approved by AICTE. Anna University also lists Sardar Raja College of Engineering on its Tenkasi district college page.\n\nThe college lists teaching in mechanical engineering, electrical and electronics engineering, electronics and communication engineering, computer science engineering, and artificial intelligence and data science. Its listed postgraduate offerings include a Master of Engineering in computer science and engineering and a Master of Computer Applications."
